I walk to the office.
My office is nearby.
But today is very hot.
It is morning now.
Even so, it is very sunny outside.
It is very hot in Kochi in March.
There is a lot of humidity in the air.
I am sweating a lot.
Therefore, I walk slowly.
There are big trees on the street.
I walk through the shade of the trees.
I look at the sky.
There are no clouds in the sky.
I have an umbrella in my bag.
There are only a few people on the street.
I see the office building.
I need to reach the AC office quickly.
I walk there quickly.
